    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="143" status="pending (server + schema steps only)">Supplies `sprk_subjectsystemuser`, the three-subject malformed-row rule, the enforce endpoint, the form library this task extends (or co-creates, escalation (g)), and the N5 outcome this task displays. 143's form steps and live gate run AFTER this task, on this task's form (143 amendment n="UX").</dependency>
      <dependency task="067" status="pending (coordination)">Manage Access is the record-level surface for Write-holders. This task does not duplicate it on project, matter or work-assignment forms.</dependency>
      <dependency task="153" status="pending (downstream)">Registers its banner library on the Organization and Contact forms after this task, and its copy points at the NO ACCESS section built here.</dependency>
